<title>NETHERLANDS: Fortis Amev Q1 profit 224 mln guilders.</title>
<headline>Fortis Amev Q1 profit 224 mln guilders.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Q1 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)		  1.23 vs   0.94</p>
<p>    Net profit				224    vs 171</p>
<p>    Share in profit of Fortis Group   222    vs 162</p>
<p>    Other income				2    vs   9</p>
<p>NOTE - Fortis Amev was expected by analysts to produce a 1997 first quarter net profit of 193-205 million guilders. Net per share in Q1 1996 has been restated to reflect a two-for-five share split last year.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
